{
  "name": "HSC-03 - Create Deal & Update Lifecycle Stage [Dev]",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HSC-03 - Create Deal & Update Lifecycle Stage [Dev]\n\n**Owned By:** Ronny Kalaksanan\n**Last Updated:** 2026-08-21\n\n**Description:**\nBagian dari Layer 2 (Pipeline & Lifecycle). Untuk contact yang sudah masuk (dari HSC-01/HSC-02), workflow ini membuat Deal baru di pipeline 'Alurio Client Acquisition' pada stage awal (Discovery Call), sekaligus update lifecycle stage contact jadi 'Lead'.\n\n**Flow:**\n1. TriggerManualTest - trigger uji coba (nanti bisa diganti trigger otomatis dari HSC-02)\n2. PrepareTestContactData - isi ID contact + nama deal buat testing\n3. CreateDeal - POST ke HubSpot Deals API, associate ke contact, stage 'appointmentscheduled'\n4. LogSyncResult / LogSyncError\n\n**Dependencies:**\n- Credential: \"HubSpot Private App Token\" (scope: crm.objects.deals.read/write, crm.objects.contacts.write)\n- Pipeline ID: default | Stage ID Discovery Call: appointmentscheduled\n- ErrorHandler [Global] workflow (belum disambungkan di iterasi ini - next step)",
        "height": 592,
        "width": 692,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "14646159-bb28-4609-a9ac-29d466508ea3",
      "name": "README",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -160,
        -432
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.hubapi.com/crm/v3/objects/deals",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { \"properties\": { \"dealname\": $json.dealname, \"pipeline\": \"default\", \"dealstage\": \"appointmentscheduled\" }, \"associations\": [ { \"to\": { \"id\": $json.hubspotContactId }, \"types\": [ { \"associationCategory\": \"HUBSPOT_DEFINED\", \"associationTypeId\": 3 } ] } ] } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
